tarcaller's Watch","text":"Elemental Mastery catalyst that buffs the active character after creating a shield."},{"name":"Sacrificial Jade","text":"Sacrificial Jade provides CRIT Rate, a massive HP boost, and EM to strengthen Mualani’s Vaporize damage—but watch for CRIT overcapping with Obsidian Codex."},{"name":"Ring of Yaxche","text":"Ring of Yaxche provides a hefty HP% boost and increases Mualani’s Normal Attack damage after using her Skill, making it a strong craftable F2P option."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"On-switch random buffs include Elemental Mastery or DMG%."},{"name":"Ash-Graven Drinking Horn","text":"HP% event catalyst with an occasional HP-scaling Physical hit; mostly an HP stat stick for Mualani. HP stat stick; passive does Physical damage."}],"a":[{"names":["Obsidian Codex"],"text":"Obsidian Codex provides 15% increased damage and 40% CRIT Rate, making it Mualani’s best set and freeing up artifact substats for HP%, EM, and CRIT DMG.","stats":"HP%/EM · Hydro DMG Bonus/HP% · CR/CD/HP%"},{"names":["Unfinished Reverie"],"text":"Unfinished Reverie boosts Mualani’s damage against Burning enemies, making it a niche option for Burn-Vape teams.","stats":""},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Marechaussee Hunter provides 15% Normal Attack DMG and up to 36% CRIT Rate with Furina, making it a solid alternative for Mualani’s Sharky’s Bites. Obsidian Codex remains stronger overall.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Sharknado","members":["Mualani","Mavuika","Citlali","Xilonen"],"text":"Mavuika applies Pyro for Mualani to Vaporize. Xilonen supports her damage, while Citlali offers shielding but can complicate Pyro aura management.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Res Shred","Support"]},{"name":"Shark Week","members":["Mualani","Mavuika","Emilie","Xilonen"],"text":"Mualani drives Vaporize damage, Mavuika provides off-field Pyro, Emilie adds Burning damage, and Xilonen shreds RES and buffs the team.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Burn","Support"]},{"name":"Jaws & Order","members":["Mualani","Furina","Xiangling","Xilonen"],"text":"Furina buffs Mualani but her Hydro can compete for the Pyro aura. Xiangling must maintain strong Pyro application, while Xilonen heals and shreds RES.","roles":["Main DPS","Buffs","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Coupon Cabana","members":["Mualani","Yaoyao","Xiangling","Sucrose"],"text":"Mualani drives Vaporize damage, Xiangling provides Pyro, Yaoyao heals and supports Bloom reactions, and Sucrose boosts EM and shreds RES.","roles":["Main DPS","Support","Sub DPS","EM Build"]}],"v":"Vaporize Shark Bites: Maximize Mualani’s large forward-Vaporize shark attacks.\nBurning Vape: Burning can maintain reaction uptime for Mualani’s bite windows.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Mualani is an HP scaling Hydro DPS built around huge, front loaded Sharky’s Bite damage. She excels in Vaporize teams, trading rapid attacks for fewer, massive hits.","pros":["Huge Vape damage","Great mobility","HP-based scaling","Strong exploration"],"cons":["Misses feel punishing","Vape dependent","Unusual playstyle","Wants specific supports"],"weapons":["Surf's Up","Tome of the Eternal Flow","A Thousand Floating Dreams","Starcaller's Watch","Sacrificial Jade","Ring of Yaxche","The Widsith","Ash-Graven Drinking Horn"],"arts":[{"sets":["Obsidian Codex"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Unfinished Reverie"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"}],"main":["HP% / Elemental Mastery","Hydro DMG Bonus / HP%","Crit Rate / Crit DMG / HP%"],"stats":["HP: 32,000-38,000+","Crit Rate: 40% - 50% (Codex)","Crit DMG: 200%+","Elemental Mastery: 100-200"],"vars":[{"title":"Vaporize Shark Bites","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Surf's Up","Sacrificial Jade","Ring of Yaxche"],"arts":[{"sets":["Obsidian Codex"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% / Hydro DMG / CRIT; Codex supplies CRIT Rate.","teams":"Off-field Pyro that maintains aura for bites.","when":"Maximize Mualani’s large 